Package: resman
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Francesco Defilippo <francesco@defilippo.org>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Homepage: https://github.com/fdefilippo/resman
Description: per-user CPU, memory and IO manager for cgroups v2
 ResMan monitors Linux resource usage and dynamically applies cgroups v2
 limits to selected users when configured thresholds are exceeded.
 .
 It provides Prometheus metrics, PSI event-driven control, configuration
 hot reload, SQLite history, limit notifications and an optional MCP server.
